{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0078"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c007): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c007.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0078"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge history/modern-history","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/history__modern-history.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",44],["-","Five"],["+","Six"],["=",41],["-","it"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","world "],["=",2],["-","divided"],["+","ordered"],["=",423],["+","**San Francisco, April–June 1945.** Delegates of fifty nations met to turn the Yalta promise into a treaty, and on 26 June 1945 they signed the Charter of the United Nations. It entered into force on 24 October 1945, once the five permanent members of the Security Council and a majority of the other signatories had ratified it – the official birthday of the UN, celebrated ever since as United Nations Day.\n\n"],["=",10],["+","wartime "],["=",256],["+","San Francisco | signed 26 June 1945 | 50 nations | UN Charter, in force from 24 October 1945 |\n| "],["=",42],["-","five "],["=",32],["-","hold."],["+","hold – which is why the one meant to outlast them all was written as a charter for every member state."]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",40],["-","Fünf"],["+","Sechs"],["=",41],["-","es"],["+","die"],["=",1],["+","Welt "],["=",2],["-","erneut"],["+","neu"],["=",1],["-","geteilt"],["+","geordnet"],["=",415],["+","**San Francisco, April–Juni 1945.** Delegierte aus fünfzig Staaten kamen zusammen, um das Versprechen von Jalta in einen Vertrag zu gießen, und am 26. Juni 1945 unterzeichneten sie die Charta der Vereinten Nationen. Sie trat am 24. Oktober 1945 in Kraft, nachdem die fünf ständigen Mitglieder des Sicherheitsrats und eine Mehrheit der übrigen Unterzeichner sie ratifiziert hatten – der offizielle Geburtstag der UNO, der seither als Tag der Vereinten Nationen begangen wird.\n\n"],["=",12],["+","der Kriegszeit "],["=",238],["+","San Francisco | unterzeichnet 26. Juni 1945 | 50 Staaten | UN-Charta, in Kraft seit 24. Oktober 1945 |\n| "],["=",42],["-","fünf "],["=",30],["-","selten."],["+","selten – weshalb dasjenige, das sie alle überdauern sollte, als Charta für jeden Mitgliedstaat geschrieben wurde."]]}]},
